<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Presentations Portfolio | Indu Behera</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Presentation portfolio by Indu Behera featuring strategy decks, GTM narratives, AI use-case presentations, and commercial storytelling work.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1f2933;
      background: #f6f3ef;
    }

    .page {
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 32px 24px 56px;
    }

    .back-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      color: #6b5f57;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4ebe3 100%);
      border: 1px solid #eadfd6;
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 56px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(72, 55, 39, 0.08);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #9a6b45;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 860px;
      font-size: 52px;
      line-height: 1.08;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      color: #1f2933;
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 19px;
      color: #5b6470;
    }

    .summary-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .summary-item {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      border: 1px solid #eadfd6;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .summary-item strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 22px;
      color: #1f2933;
    }

    .summary-item span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #6b7280;
    }

    .section-intro {
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 0 0 34px;
      padding: 0 4px;
    }

    .section-intro h2,
    .samples-header h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #1f2933;
    }

    .section-intro p,
    .samples-header p {
      color: #5b6470;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .samples-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: flex-end;
      margin-top: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding: 0 4px;
    }

    .samples-header p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .portfolio-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .portfolio-card {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 420px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #eadfd6;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 16px 35px rgba(72, 55, 39, 0.07);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .portfolio-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 22px 45px rgba(72, 55, 39, 0.12);
    }

    .card-number {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #1f2933;
      color: #ffffff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      align-self: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #8a5a35;
      background: #f6ede5;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .portfolio-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #1f2933;
    }

    .portfolio-card p {
      color: #5b6470;
      font-size: 15.5px;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    .focus {
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eee4dc;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .focus strong {
      color: #1f2933;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #1f2933;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #3a4654;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 48px;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid #eadfd6;
      color: #7b7169;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 36px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .summary-strip,
      .portfolio-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .samples-header {
        display: block;
      }

      .portfolio-card {
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .page {
        padding: 20px 16px 40px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 28px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 34px;
      }

      .intro {
        font-size: 17px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="page">

    <a class="back-link" href="../index.html">← Back to Home</a>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Presentations Portfolio</div>
      <h1>Presentation-led storytelling across strategy, GTM, AI, and commercial transformation.</h1>
      <p class="intro">
        A curated collection of presentation work that demonstrates strategic storytelling,
        executive communication, GTM narrative development, AI use-case framing, and
        commercial value articulation.
      </p>

      <div class="summary-strip">
        <div class="summary-item">
          <strong>03</strong>
          <span>Featured presentations</span>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-item">
          <strong>Strategy</strong>
          <span>Executive and commercial narratives</span>
        </div>
        <div class="summary-item">
          <strong>AI + GTM</strong>
          <span>Use-case framing and market storytelling</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>

      <section class="section-intro">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
          This section highlights selected presentation samples that show how complex
          strategy, market, and AI-led ideas can be structured into clear narratives
          for business, commercial, and stakeholder decision-making.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <div class="samples-header">
          <div>
            <h2>Featured Presentations</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Presentation samples will be added here as curated cards with short context,
            focus areas, and links to view the work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="portfolio-grid">

          <!-- Presentation cards will go here -->

        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>© Indu Behera · Presentations Portfolio</p>
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
